sequenceDiagram
    actor U as SME analyst
    participant B as Browser
    participant F as analyse.php (front end)
    participant A as Flask API (core engine)
    participant M as XGBoost + TreeSHAP
    participant D as Database (back end)
    U->>B: choose CSV, click "Analyse file"
    B->>F: POST multipart/form-data
    F->>F: check file present, .csv, ≤ 5 MB, ≤ 5,000 rows, header
    alt file invalid
        F-->>B: page with plain-language error message
    else file valid
        F->>A: POST /predict_raw {flows: [...]}
        A->>A: check required columns, coerce values, flag invalid rows
        alt columns missing
            A-->>F: 400 {error: "...columns missing..."}
            F-->>B: error message
        else
            A->>A: Min-Max scaling (training scaler)
            A->>M: predict + pred_contribs
            M-->>A: probabilities, SHAP values
            A-->>F: 200 {results, n_invalid_rows, server_ms}
            F->>D: INSERT analysis_run, INSERT predictions (transaction)
            D-->>F: run id
            F-->>B: KPIs + alerts table with top-3 reasons
        end
    end
    B-->>U: results page
